            "x": 0,
            "y": -12.8,
            "text": "LM317 set to 3.3 V"
          },
          {
            "id": "an2",
            "kind": "label",
            "x": 0,
            "y": -11,
            "text": "The LM317 (ADJ · OUT · IN from the left) holds OUT 1.25 V above ADJ: R1, 240 Ω",
            "color": "#808080"
          },
          {
            "id": "an3",
            "kind": "label",
            "x": 0,
            "y": -9.2,
            "text": "from OUT to ADJ, and R2, 390 Ω from ADJ to ground, make",
            "color": "#808080"
          },
          {
            "id": "an4",
            "kind": "label",
            "x": 0,
            "y": -7.4,
            "text": "Vout = 1.25 V × (1 + 390 / 240) ≈ 3.3 V on the bottom rail, which lights the LED.",
            "color": "#808080"
          },
          {
            "id": "an5",
            "kind": "label",
            "x": 0,
            "y": -5.6,
            "text": "Change R2 in its Properties to set another voltage — 1 kΩ gives 6.5 V — and",
            "color": "#808080"
          },
          {
            "id": "an6",
            "kind": "label",
            "x": 0,
            "y": -3.8,
            "text": "keep the input 1.7 V above it. Probe OUT under Spice Lite.",
            "color": "#808080"
          }
        ],
